                                                "sense_id": "a6aba756-12b1-3330-9171-302d160d1968",
                                                "text": "In 1866 Colonel J. F. Meline noted that the rebozo had almost disappeared in Santa Fe and that hoop skirts, on sale in the stores, were being widely used."
